h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01d023c5-bef1-4198-8d27-c80a449167d1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"誰も気にしてなくて実装も楽だからこうなってる雰囲気は感じる","ts":"1618147489.235000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ulx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0b07691-3dea-4f29-b0af-32f5185db1db","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"依存が入るのは別にいいんですけど、依存で入っただけのツールの bin を使いたいって人はまずいないはずなので、それが .bin に入るのは挙動としておかしい気がするんですよねぇ","ts":"1618147469.234600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RBDLt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc1de458-7efd-41d4-bf68-def17048fd05","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、通常のパッケージ管理の依存関係でも、わりといろいろ入るからな...難しい","ts":"1618147404.233800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b3b9z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea6aa550-80dc-4bcd-b4c1-2cd5039c07d7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"汎用というかグローバルはたしかにそうですね...そこに依存の、だけど使う気のないのがはいるのはちょっと困るのはたしか","ts":"1618147369.233300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qbyak"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78868b63-bc64-4c37-a405-bb566be8a97a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"npm のツールを独立した場所にインストールするツールを作ってるところなんですよね。-g で入れるのではなくて所定の場所に空のプロジェクト作ってそこに CLI を入れて bin だけ外に通す感じのやつ。uninstall を手軽にできるように","ts":"1618147361.233100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H1U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e696809-2aeb-40af-baae-1a0a04a3d21e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"使いたいツールはわかってるから、それの bin だけリンク貼ればいいのでは？何を気にされてるのかがよくわからない。","ts":"1618147222.231200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Io"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47dcab35-3fc7-4a17-a3bc-0f6088df4c68","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うかその需要がないなら Node.js で汎用コマンドラインツール(特定のプロジェクトでのみ使うのではない CLI)は作るなって話になる","ts":"1618147180.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/26"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d7377a5-7cd2-480e-b862-2c0ac69decdf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"npm にリリースされているコマンドラインツールをグローバルに入れたい場合ってのはそれなりにあるんですよね","ts":"1618147129.229500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5VtA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a33d59ec-9841-4081-8ee6-4e6793d2f3c6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"それは違うと思う。","ts":"1618147104.229000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zYR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9bee27c-2c48-471b-bdc3-d2205fa5b1ce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、`.bin` はパスにいれるべきじゃなくnpxで呼べなんじゃないかなあ...感?","ts":"1618147079.228700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"omxC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09606658-5be7-4176-b232-cfa827579b17","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`node_modules/.bin` に PATH 通すと色々と死ぬ","ts":"1618146888.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qt6UU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76b1b158-e9d0-4057-a7da-5255139a7494","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"グローバルに滅多に入れない(eslint_d くらい)","ts":"1618146850.227400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"df/n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3027e7bc-d19a-40ad-a879-ac7f4b7338bb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"正直不便","ts":"1618146848.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y3OIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c0ad845-d29e-4694-b962-18492ddad324","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"導入して消したことがある","ts":"1618146828.226700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DfW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c99f569-00de-49be-a4c0-b77b68faed79","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"特にこれグローバルインストールしたらいらんもんも全部入るってことだよね","ts":"1618146798.226200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MSK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6abe3638-7b7d-47c3-8aa0-4fa4719ddaee","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":fuben:","ts":"1618146764.225800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brnAF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a8bd0cd-d297-4ad5-a173-060698f3550a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一応yarnも見てみたけどそれっぽいオプションはないな","ts":"1618146744.225600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=YI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43d5c78e-508e-4b52-847a-e4e317ee7f5d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"余計なものを PATH に入れたくないので需要ありそうなのに、なんでこうなってるんだろう。むしろデフォルトで直指定の以外 .bin に入れないでほしいのだけど…","ts":"1618146634.225300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76+d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea348df3-38ef-4bf5-bba2-f4247d9da6bd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"devじゃない依存だし、入れない、という処理自体が問題になるパターンもありそう(中でバイナリ呼ぶとか)","ts":"1618146631.225200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VouP="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c33836b-f731-4066-a839-df0b29110dce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自分で ln 貼るのは困難じゃないですかね。どこに張るべきかを判断するロジックがめちゃくちゃ複雑","ts":"1618146585.224100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OHxLA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee9511e3-1e75-4e8d-a268-2528c0e5b0c8","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`--no-bin-links` だと全部入らなくなるしなぁ。やるとしたら `--no-bin-links` して自分で ln はるとかですかね。","t